,"gloss":"And gardens","transliteration":"waḥadāiqa","lemma":"حَدَآئِق","root":"حدق","entryId":null},{"key":"80:30:2","position":2,"arabic":"غُلْبًۭا","kind":"word","gloss":"(of) thick foliage","transliteration":"ghul'ban","lemma":"غُلْب","root":"غلب","entryId":null},{"key":"80:30:3","position":3,"arabic":"٣٠","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"80:31","translation":"And fruits and herbage","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"80:31:1","position":1,"arabic":"وَفَـٰكِهَةًۭ","kind":"word","gloss":"And fruits","transliteration":"wafākihatan","lemma":"فَٰكِهَة","root":"فكه","entryId":null},{"key":"80:31:2","position":2,"arabic":"وَأَبًّۭا","kind":"word","gloss":"and grass","transliteration":"wa-abban","lemma":"أَبّ","root":"ابب","entryId":null},{"key":"80:31:3","position":3,"arabic":"٣١","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"80:32","translation":"(To be) a provision and benefit for you and your cattle.","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"80:32:1","position":1,"arabic":"مَّتَـٰعًۭا","kind":"word","gloss":"(As) a provision","transliteration":"matāʿan","lemma":"مَتَٰع","root":"متع","entryId":null},{"key":"80:32:2","position":2,"arabic":"لَّكُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null},{"key":"80:32:3","position":3,"arabic":"وَلِأَنْعَـٰمِكُمْ","kind":"word","gloss":"and for your cattle","transliteration":"wali-anʿāmikum","lemma":"نَّعَم","root":"نعم","entryId":null},{"key":"80:32:4","position":4,"arabic":"٣٢","kind":"end-marker","gloss":"","transliteration":"","lemma":null,"root":null,"entryId":null}]},{"ref":"80:33","translation":"Then when there comes As-Sâkhkhah (the second blowing of the Trumpet on the Day of Resurrection)","translationSource":"qul-301-hilali-khan","notes":[],"tokens":[{"key":"80:33:1","position"